Cell["\<\
Check: {True, True, True}: with the grammar every answer is a valid tree, and \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]any in beam\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is never below \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]top answer\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], since it counts \
the top answer too.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"585f6eec-41a5-4b6d-8285-5294a4da2c53"],

